<title>THAILAND: PTT Exploration to borrow in Japan.</title>
<headline>PTT Exploration to borrow in Japan.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's PTT Exploration and Production Plc said on Tuesday it plans to borrow funds in the Japanese market as part of its $200 million of foreign borrowings for 1997.</p>
<p>PTT Exploration said in a filing to the Stock Exchange of Thailand that the company had received an &quot;AA&quot; credit rating from Japan Credit Rating Agency Ltd.</p>
<p>The $200 million foreign loans in 1997 will be used to finance the company's Pailin project in the Gulf of Thailand, it said.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
